Subject: [PATCH 137/144] GreatDANE: drop the extra blank line after the
 official bookmark #endif (round 4i)

Delete the blank line after the new #endif that closes the official
icon-define block in default-bookmarks.html (source line 18 at the 4h
tip). Official preprocess with MOZ_OFFICIAL_BRANDING is then
byte-identical to stock ESR153 default-bookmarks.html. The unofficial
branch is unchanged in substance (Get Involved still points at
https://dane.surf/source/; Customize remains omitted).

Prepared only. Not built, signed, notarized or published.
